  {
    "family": "least_significant_one_value",
    "name": "collect_lowbit_values",
    "arg": "numbers",
    "member_type": "int",
    "operation": "numbers 是非负整数列表。对每个整数 n，求二进制表示中最低位的 1 所代表的数值；n 为零时结果为零。例如 12 的结果为 4，10 的结果为 2。",
    "expression": "n & -n for n in numbers",
    "cases": [
      [
        "empty",
        [],
        []
      ],
      [
        "duplicates",
        [
          12,
          10,
          12,
          6
        ],
        [
          4,
          2
        ]
      ],
      [
        "boundary",
        [
          0,
          1,
          16,
          128
        ],
        [
          0,
          1,
          16,
          128
        ]
      ],
      [
        "ordinary",
        [
          7,
          24,
          40
        ],
        [
          1,
          8
        ]
      ]
    ],
    "nearest": [
      "gray_words",
      "ceiling_binary_exponents",
      "swapped_u16_values"
    ],
    "review": "Isolates the least significant nonzero bit value. Gray encoding mixes bits, ceiling binary exponent measures magnitude, byte swap permutes fixed-width bytes. None becomes this transform by renaming or changing a constant; shared bit operations are disclosed."
  },
  {
    "family": "modal_member_selection",
    "name": "collect_modal_members",
    "arg": "numbers",
    "member_type": "int",
    "operation": "numbers 是整数列表。收集在整个列表中出现次数达到最大值的所有整数，出现次数并列第一时全部保留；空输入得到空结果。",
    "expression": "n for n in numbers if numbers.count(n) == max((numbers.count(v) for v in numbers), default=0)",
